OL,3,GNEWSAPolice detective charged with
OL,4,Aintentional strangulation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving police detective has been
OL,7,Fcharged with controlling behaviour and
OL,8,Fstrangulation.
OL,10,FDet Sgt Karl Ralph, 48, of Thames
OL,11,FValley Police, is accused of one count
OL,12,Fof engaging in controlling and coercive
OL,13,Fbehaviour and two counts of intentional
OL,14,Fstrangulation.
OL,16,FBased at the force's Headquarters South
OL,17,Fin Kidlington, Oxfordshire, he is
OL,18,Fcurrently suspended from duty, a Thames
OL,19,FValley Police spokesperson said.
OL,21,FHe is set to appear at Luton
OL,22,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
